      "value": "Swift Swim"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "I find I need to spend a large part of my time in the water. However, threats and predators there make the experience nerve wracking. So, I devised a way to help control the water currents around me in order to propel me forward and "
        },
        {
          "text": "allow me to swim much faster",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nThat should help even the scales, provided I can hold my breath long enough."
        }
      ]
    }
